{"4745310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tachyon Fire", "steam_appid": 4745310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745310/extras/2315c55b1dc72c6b27b1a6dd9442d98d.poster.avif?t=1785173973\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745310/extras/2315c55b1dc72c6b27b1a6dd9442d98d.webm?t=1785173973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745310/extras/2315c55b1dc72c6b27b1a6dd9442d98d.mp4?t=1785173973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tachyon Fire</i> </strong>is a fast-paced arena FPS inspired by the gameplay of <i>Devil Daggers</i>, the movement of <i>Tribes</i>, and the game-feel of <i>Quake III. </i> Evolve your weapons using the harvested energy of your enemies. Master each level by optimizing your movement and crowd control to achieve the fastest completion time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong><br>Mechanical fiends have overrun the projected realm of the collective unconscious. With the Kali Yuga reaching its 400,000-year apex, it falls to you, Metatron, to blast them to smithereens and purge the Akashic code of their corruption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS, Purified</strong><br>There is no fall damage, reloading, regenerating health, or randomly generated gameplay. Your strategy, movement, and aim  alone determine your fate in the arena. Rapidly switch between 3 distinct weapons, each with 3 upgrade levels, to annihilate foes with escalating intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undulating Walls of Flesh and Chrome</strong><br>Learn to overpower nine enemy types as massive swarms overwhelm you. Some will slither and coil, others will lumber, and still others will swirl into clouds or raise fluid shield-walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement Sandbox</strong><br>Ski, slide, bounce, bunny hop, shotgun jump, and machine-gun boost across the arena however you choose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack from Mombius.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demiurge</strong><br>Enjoy a handcrafted experience built almost entirely by a single developer. The  engine, levels, sound design and most models were created from the ground up as a labor of love.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745310/extras/2315c55b1dc72c6b27b1a6dd9442d98d.poster.avif?t=1785173973\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745310/extras/2315c55b1dc72c6b27b1a6dd9442d98d.webm?t=1785173973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745310/extras/2315c55b1dc72c6b27b1a6dd9442d98d.mp4?t=1785173973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tachyon Fire</i> </strong>is a fast-paced arena FPS inspired by the gameplay of <i>Devil Daggers</i>, the movement of <i>Tribes</i>, and the game-feel of <i>Quake III. </i> Evolve your weapons using the harvested energy of your enemies. Master each level by optimizing your movement and crowd control to achieve the fastest completion time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong><br>Mechanical fiends have overrun the projected realm of the collective unconscious. With the Kali Yuga reaching its 400,000-year apex, it falls to you, Metatron, to blast them to smithereens and purge the Akashic code of their corruption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS, Purified</strong><br>There is no fall damage, reloading, regenerating health, or randomly generated gameplay. Your strategy, movement, and aim  alone determine your fate in the arena. Rapidly switch between 3 distinct weapons, each with 3 upgrade levels, to annihilate foes with escalating intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undulating Walls of Flesh and Chrome</strong><br>Learn to overpower nine enemy types as massive swarms overwhelm you. Some will slither and coil, others will lumber, and still others will swirl into clouds or raise fluid shield-walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement Sandbox</strong><br>Ski, slide, bounce, bunny hop, shotgun jump, and machine-gun boost across the arena however you choose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack from Mombius.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demiurge</strong><br>Enjoy a handcrafted experience built almost entirely by a single developer. The  engine, levels, sound design and most models were created from the ground up as a labor of love.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Tachyon Fire is a hectic movement-focused arena shooter that pits you against an army of surreal mechanical creatures in a nightmarish dreamscape. Ski, slide, and launch yourself through the air while tearing apart the horde with unlimited firepower and a magic hammer.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745310/71e1d3e5f8f7da3f485ef29cbc78718a4c136e16/header.jpg?t=1785173973", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/